{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Luxa 是一款專為 iPhone 打造的自然 RAW 相機，適合追求攝影質感與色彩控制的用戶。它提供 Leica、Fujifilm 及 Kodak 等經典風格，讓你在拍攝時即可獲得富有層次的影像效果。這款工具目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價為 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-214.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多樣化RAW處理引擎</h2>\n<p>App 內建三種圖像處理引擎：Process Zero RAW、Apple ProRAW 及 Apple Processed，滿足不同後製需求。你可選擇低幹預的 RAW 起點或結合計算攝影的 ProRAW，並自由調整風格強度與顆粒感。支援手動快門、光圈及白平衡控制，兼具自動模式的便利性與專業級的細節掌控力。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-44.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-45.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-46.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-47.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-48.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-49.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Luxa RAW Camera</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/luxa-raw-camera/id6809432210?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.345742+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:11:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:24.066771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:20.030710+00:00","content_hash":"cacf6b92704084971f3b4361062d3c36cc2ac45dce8ad1746c03b7368f04fab3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}